        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The provisions of this Article 26 shall be applicable to Employees in the title of Communication Services Installer only. All provisions of CWA-24, Appendices 2 and 3, the Local Memoranda and the National Memorandum shall apply to this Article 26 as if fully restated herein, except as expressly modified, replaced or deleted by the provisions of this Article 26.",
